flowchart TD
  A[Create Draft] --> B[Complete required fields]
  B --> C{Validate submission}
  C -->|fail| B
  C -->|ok| D[Submit]
  D --> E[Audit: submit]
  E --> F[Submitted]
  F --> G[PMO start_review]
  G --> H[Under Review]
  H --> I{PMO decision}
  I -->|return + reason| J[Returned]
  J --> B
  I -->|reject + reason| K[Rejected]
  I -->|recommend_approve| L[Pending Approval]
  L --> M{Executive decision}
  M -->|approve| N[Approved]
  M -->|return| J
  M -->|reject| K
  N --> O[Activate]
  O --> P[Active]
  P --> Q[Notifications demo: audit trail]
  D --> Q
  I --> Q
  M --> Q
